# Normalise line endings in the repository, not on checkout. Without this, every file
# shows as modified on a machine whose core.autocrlf differs, which buries the real
# diff -- and a test suite that must be runnable from a clean clone should not depend
# on the cloner's git configuration.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Windows-only build script; keep it LF too, PowerShell accepts both.
*.ps1 text eol=lf

# Binaries (none are tracked today; this states the intent rather than the fact).
*.exe binary
*.dll binary
*.png  binary